# A fallen (monstats 19, fallen1, specs/monsters/ai.md §9 table) spawned
# next to the character in the Rogue Encampment at tick 1, then pokes
# (specs/tools/poke.md): its unit seed set at tick 2, a brazier (objects
# row 39, specs/audio/triggers.md Test vectors, as traces/pokes/
# spawn-town.poke) created beside the character at tick 3, the act's
# time of day set at tick 4. Every tick is a snapshot: the check of poke.md (test
# vectors) is the poke and spawn records and the fallen's first 50 ticks
# of unit records, 1.14d against d2rs.
scenario 1
name poke-spawn-town
game 1.14d
seed 0x00001234
init 644409375         # game +0x7C (tools/original-hooks.md §2): the DRLG seed
difficulty normal
expansion yes
end 52

char save ScnSor     # the save the original side loads (handoff §3)
char class 1
char area 0 1
char at default

record s2c rng units
snapshot every 1

at 1 spawn 19 @x+4 @y normal
at 2 poke seed-unit @1:19 0x12345678 666
at 3 poke object 39 @x-6 @y
at 4 poke time 2 0
